{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","瑟恩（未完整）"],["/names/en","Thane (incomplete)"],["/description_i18n/cn","在神秘力量的影响下，您目前还无法获取这名角色的详细情报。"],["/description_i18n/en","Under the influence of a mysterious power, you can't gather detailed information about this character."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","还有很多事务要处理"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I still have plenty of matters to attend to."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","即使在这里也不能放松警惕"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","We mustn't lower our guard, even here."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","比巴登的手艺好多了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This is way better than Baden's cooking!"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","不需要特别在意我的手臂。从战场上归来，难免有所残缺。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","No need to worry about my arm. Soldiers don't always come home from war in one piece."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/machine_locales/en","mt/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","瑟恩（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Thane (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","又要与班题斯交手了，而且还是在班题斯的领土上。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","And now we're going up against Bantus again—on their own ground, no less."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411110.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411110.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","瑟恩（未完整） & 爱丝特瑞达"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Thane (incomplete) & Estrilda"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","你应当知道灰影郡是什么地方。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","You know what kind of place Ashvale County is."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411120.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411120.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","瑟恩（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Thane (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","好久没有跳舞，感觉舞步都有些生疏了。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","It's been so long since I danced. I'm getting rusty."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411130.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411130.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","爱丝特瑞达 & 瑟恩（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Estrilda & Thane (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这座城堡很诡异。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","There's something wrong with this castle."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411140.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411140.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","瑟恩（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Thane (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","我以前从没想过，自己有一天竟然会来到亡灵的领地上生活，而且还处于失忆状态。"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","I never imagined I'd wind up living among the Graveborn—let alone with no memory of who I was."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep8/herohub_story/18411160.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep8/herohub_story/18411160.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","里纳 & 瑟恩（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Rain & Thane (incomplete)"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","啊，一位战场幸存者，有着无比坚韧的灵魂。"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Ah, a survivor of the battlefield... Your soul is remarkably resilient."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415804.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/104158